Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.25,0:00:03.89,TL,,0,0,0,,从开年捧杯 到温网首轮失利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.89,0:00:05.66,TL,,0,0,0,,斯维托丽娜的这一季
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.66,0:00:09.12,TL,,0,0,0,,最终走回了阔别{\fs78}7{\fs68}年的年终舞台
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.57,0:00:11.05,TL,,0,0,0,,她的{\fs78}2026{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.05,0:00:13.08,TL,,0,0,0,,从奥克兰冠军开始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.08,0:00:15.22,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛两盘战胜王欣瑜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.22,0:00:17.19,TL,,0,0,0,,先把上一季末的四连败
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.19,0:00:19.67,TL,,0,0,0,,换成了开年的五连胜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.24,0:00:29.14,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Elina Svitolina is the champion in Auckland.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N斯维托丽娜赢下奥克兰冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.76,0:00:33.30,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Her 19th career title,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她职业生涯的第{\fs78}19{\fs68}冠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.30,0:00:36.24,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and she had to work hard for it in this final.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这场决赛她赢得很艰难
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.57,0:00:39.16,TL,,0,0,0,,这股势头延续到墨尔本
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.16,0:00:41.14,TL,,0,0,0,,连胜安德烈娃 高芙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.14,0:00:43.06,TL,,0,0,0,,她第一次闯进澳网四强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.06,0:00:46.48,TL,,0,0,0,,再往前一步 萨巴伦卡挡住了她
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:01:03.12,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So impressive from the world No. 1.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N世界第一 表现太出色了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.12,0:01:08.50,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Sabalenka moves through to the final once again in Melbourne.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N萨巴伦卡再次闯进墨尔本决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.85,0:01:10.42,TL,,0,0,0,,多哈第三轮止步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.42,0:01:12.34,TL,,0,0,0,,迪拜又走到决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.34,0:01:14.54,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛和高芙打满{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.21,TL,,0,0,0,,最后的冠军战 她两盘负于佩古拉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.58,0:01:25.16,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is a dream debut Dubai title{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N梦幻般的迪拜首冠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.16,0:01:26.92,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}for Jessica Pegula,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N属于杰西卡 佩古拉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.92,0:01:31.04,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and she seals it in style with an ace.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她用一记{\fs78}ACE{\fs68}漂亮收官
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.25,0:01:33.36,TL,,0,0,0,,印第安维尔斯和斯图加特
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.36,0:01:34.66,TL,,0,0,0,,都打进四强
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.66,0:01:38.18,TL,,0,0,0,,迈阿密第三轮 马德里第二轮出局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.65,0:01:40.00,TL,,0,0,0,,罗马连续{\fs78}3{\fs68}场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.00,0:01:43.34,TL,,0,0,0,,击败莱巴金娜 斯瓦泰克和高芙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.34,0:01:45.04,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛丢掉第二盘后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.04,0:01:47.47,TL,,0,0,0,,她用{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}拿下决胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.47,0:01:48.91,TL,,0,0,0,,第三座罗马奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.91,0:01:51.46,TL,,0,0,0,,也是职业生涯第{\fs78}20{\fs68}冠
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.80,0:02:12.52,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Elina Svitolina is a Roman champion once again.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N斯维托丽娜再次在罗马捧杯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.52,0:02:15.58,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The third act of a glorious trilogy{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N荣耀三部曲的第三幕
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.58,0:02:19.34,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}set under the ancient skies of the Eternal City.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N永恒之城的古老天空之下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.34,0:02:24.38,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A story of defiance, determination and perseverance,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是抗争 坚定与坚持的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.38,0:02:27.18,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}ultimately ending in glory.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N最终以荣耀作结
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.51,0:02:29.17,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I told my coach that would be nice{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我跟教练说 这样挺好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.17,0:02:32.97,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}before I finish my career to have a round number.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N生涯结束前 能凑个整数
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.97,0:02:35.67,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So he told me that hopefully{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他就说 希望
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.67,0:02:37.10,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}we're gonna get this this year.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N今年就能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.10,0:02:38.14,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So I'm glad.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N所以我很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.45,0:02:41.94,TL,,0,0,0,,带着罗马冠军来到巴黎 她打进八强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.94,0:02:45.28,TL,,0,0,0,,同胞科斯秋克用{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘赢下这场较量
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.28,0:02:48.05,TL,,0,0,0,,斯维托丽娜的法网停在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.05,0:03:07.59,TL,,0,0,0,,柏林打到八强后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.59,0:03:11.34,TL,,0,0,0,,她因右髋伤退出巴特洪堡{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.34,0:03:14.53,TL,,0,0,0,,温网首轮 一度{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}领先首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.53,0:03:17.64,TL,,0,0,0,,最终却两盘输给斯尼古尔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.10,0:03:22.74,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}There it is.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N拿下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.74,0:03:28.90,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Snigur takes the biggest win of her career,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N斯尼古尔拿下生涯最大胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.90,0:03:32.76,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}defeating fellow Ukrainian Elina Svitolina{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N击败同胞斯维托丽娜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.76,0:03:35.92,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}in straight sets on No. 2 Court,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在{\fs78}2{\fs68}号球场直落两盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.92,0:03:37.78,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and in some style.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N而且赢得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.05,0:03:39.78,TL,,0,0,0,,华盛顿止步八强
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.78,0:03:41.76,TL,,0,0,0,,多伦多再进四强
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.76,0:03:44.96,TL,,0,0,0,,面对斯瓦泰克 她用{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}扳回一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.96,0:03:47.96,TL,,0,0,0,,却还是在决胜盘败下阵来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.82,0:04:00.74,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A first final of the season,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N本赛季第一次闯进决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.74,0:04:05.10,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}a first Canadian final for Iga Swiatek.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N斯瓦泰克首进加拿大站决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.94,0:04:08.32,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Tough for Svitolina.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N斯维托丽娜很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.70,0:04:10.58,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She battled so hard.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她拼得那么顽强
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.93,0:04:14.26,TL,,0,0,0,,辛辛那提 她挽救{\fs78}7{\fs68}个赛点闯过首战
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.26,0:04:16.99,TL,,0,0,0,,随后因右踝伤退出第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.99,0:04:19.67,TL,,0,0,0,,到了美网 决胜盘{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.67,0:04:22.45,TL,,0,0,0,,最后{\fs78}4{\fs68}局全被卡林斯卡娅拿走
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.45,0:04:24.32,TL,,0,0,0,,止步第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.24,0:04:30.40,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She's done it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.40,0:04:33.72,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Anna Kalinskaya is into the last 16 in New York{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N卡林斯卡娅闯进美网第四轮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.72,0:04:37.94,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}for the first time in her career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是她职业生涯的第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.02,0:04:41.42,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a crazy, crazy roller coaster!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N真是一场疯狂的过山车
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.57,0:04:42.27,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}9{\fs68}月
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.27,0:04:44.82,TL,,0,0,0,,乌克兰首次打进比利简金杯决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.82,0:04:46.57,TL,,0,0,0,,她也是其中一员
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.57,0:04:48.21,TL,,0,0,0,,随后北京 武汉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.21,0:04:50.64,TL,,0,0,0,,连续两站打进八强
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.09,0:04:52.08,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}17{\fs68}日
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.08,0:04:55.33,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}WTA{\fs68}正式确认她获得年终资格
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.33,0:04:56.83,TL,,0,0,0,,这是她第四次入围
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.83,0:04:59.55,TL,,0,0,0,,距离上一次 已经过去{\fs78}7{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.55,0:05:01.56,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2018{\fs68}年的年终冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.56,0:05:03.76,TL,,0,0,0,,又回到了这个舞台
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.21,0:05:06.62,TL,,0,0,0,,赛季尾声 她没有参加宁波
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.62,0:05:08.41,TL,,0,0,0,,也退出了东京
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.41,0:05:09.50,TL,,0,0,0,,再回年终
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.50,0:05:12.80,TL,,0,0,0,,你期待斯维托丽娜走到哪一步？
